^ Serial connection parameters\\ for Cudy WR3000S v1 | 115200, 8N1, 3.3V |

Serial pins labeled on the bottom of the PCB, labelling is on the top of the PCB under the heatsink. Unless you have a reason to do so, do not connect the VCC/3.3V pin, only ground, TX, and RX are usually needed.

